/span><span begin="00:26.590" end="00:26.860">to </span><span begin="00:26.860" end="00:27.970">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.830" end="00:33.010"><span begin="00:29.830" end="00:30.010">That </span><span begin="00:30.010" end="00:30.670">something </span><span begin="00:30.670" end="00:31.330">was't </span><span begin="00:31.330" end="00:32.080">right </span><span begin="00:32.080" end="00:33.010">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.070" end="00:35.110"><span begin="00:33.070" end="00:33.370">Oh </span><span begin="00:33.370" end="00:34.030">baby </span><span begin="00:34.030" end="00:35.110">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.140" end="00:39.640"><span begin="00:35.140" end="00:35.350">I </span><span begin="00:35.350" end="00:36.220">shouldn't </span><span begin="00:36.220" end="00:36.490">have </span><span begin="00:36.490" end="00:37.390">let </span><span begin="00:37.390" end="00:37.870">you </span><span begin="00:37.870" end="00:39.640">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.780" end="00:43.510"><span begin="00:40.780" end="00:40.960">And </span><span begin="00:40.960" end="00:41.290">now </span><span begin="00:41.290" end="00:41.710">you're </span><span begin="00:41.710" end="00:42.040">out </span><span begin="00:42.040" end="00:42.190">of </span><span begin="00:42.190" end="00:42.940">sight</span><span begin="00:42.940" end="00:42.970">,</span><span begin="00:42.970" end="00:43.510">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.540" end="00:48.010"><span begin="00:43.540" end="00:44.290">Show </span><span begin="00:44.290" end="00:44.920">me </span><span begin="00:44.920" end="00:45.310">how </span><span begin="00:45.310" end="00:45.640">you </span><span begin="00:45.640" end="00:46.120">want </span><span begin="00:46.120" end="00:46.330">it </span><span begin="00:46.330" end="00:47.020">to </span><span begin="00:47.020" end="00:48.010">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.340" end="00:50.380"><span begin="00:48.340" end="00:48.760">Tell </span><span begin="00:48.760" end="00:49.030">me </span><span begin="00:49.030" end="00:50.380">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.410" end="00:53.200"><span begin="00:50.410" end="00:50.890">'Cause </span><span begin="00:50.890" end="00:51.130">I </span><span begin="00:51.130" end="00:51.490">need </span><span begin="00:51.490" end="00:51.700">to </span><span begin="00:51.700" end="00:52.390">know </span><span begin="00:52.390" end="00:53.200">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.200" end="00:54.760"><span begin="00:53.200" end="00:53.980">Oh </span><span begin="00:53.980" end="00:54.760">because</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.790" end="00:59.110"><span begin="00:54.790" end="00:55.180">My </span><span begin="00:55.180" end="00:56.950">loneliness </span><span begin="00:56.950" end="00:57.280">is </span><span begin="00:57.280" end="00:57.970">killing </span><span begin="00:57.970" end="00:59.110">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.110" end="01:02.140"><span begin="00:59.110" end="00:59.110">（</span><span begin="00:59.110" end="00:59.470">And </span><span begin="00:59.470" end="01:00.370">I</span><span begin="01:00.370" end="01:00.400">） </span><span begin="01:00.400" end="01:00.670">I </span><span begin="01:00.670" end="01:01.060">must </span><span begin="01:01.060" end="01:02.140">confess</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.380" end="01:05.740"><span begin="01:02.380" end="01:02.620">I </span><span begin="01:02.620" end="01:03.070">still </span><span begin="01:03.070" end="01:04.270">believe </span><span begin="01:04.270" end="01:04.270">（</span><span begin="01:04.270" end="01:04.480">still </span><span begin="01:04.480" end="01:05.710">believe</span><span begin="01:05.710" end="01:05.740">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.740" end="01:09.430"><span begin="01:05.740" end="01:06.220">When </span><span begin="01:06.220" end="01:06.460">I'm </span><span begin="01:06.460" end="01:06.820">not </span><span begin="01:06.820" end="01:07.210">with </span><span begin="01:07.210" end="01:07.600">you </span><span begin="01:07.600" end="01:07.840">I </span><span begin="01:07.840" end="01:08.230">lose </span><span begin="01:08.230" end="01:08.470">my </span><span begin="01:08.470" end="01:09.430">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.460" end="01:13.330"><span begin="01:09.460" end="01:09.880">Give </span><span begin="01:09.880" end="01:10.300">me </span><span begin="01:10.300" end="01:10.450">a </span><span begin="01:10.450" end="01:13.330">sign</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.630" end="01:16.630"><span begin="01:13.630" end="01:13.960">Hit </span><span begin="01:13.960" end="01:14.260">me </span><span begin="01:14.260" end="01:14.980">baby </span><span begin="01:14.980" end="01:15.370">one </span><span begin="01:15.370" end="01:15.640">more </span><span begin="01:15.640" end="01:16.630">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.720" end="01:18.460"><span begin="01:16.720" end="01:16.990">Oh </span><span begin="01:16.990" end="01:17.710">baby </span><span begin="01:17.710" end="01:18.460">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.700" end="01:22.630"><span begin="01:18.700" end="01:19.060">The </span><span begin="01:19.060" end="01:19.870">reason </span><span begin="01:19.870" end="01:20.110">I </span><span begin="01:20.110" end="01:21.160">breathe </span><span begin="01:21.160" end="01:21.580">is </span><span begin="01:21.580" end="01:22.630">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.550" end="01:27.370"><span begin="01:24.550" end="01:24.880">Girl </span><span begin="01:24.880" end="01:25.150">you </span><span begin="01:25.150" end="01:25.570">got </span><span begin="01:25.570" end="01:25.810">me </span><span begin="01:25.810" end="01:27.370">blinded</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.550" end="01:29.590"><span begin="01:27.550" end="01:27.850">Oh </span><span begin="01:27.850" end="01:28.570">pretty </span><span begin="01:28.570" end="01:29.590">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.620" end="01:33.790"><span begin="01:29.620" end="01:29.980">There's </span><span begin="01:29.980" end="01:30.700">nothing </span><span begin="01:30.700" end="01:31.120">that </span><span begin="01:31.120" end="01:31.930">I </span><span begin="01:31.930" end="01:32.410">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:32.410" end="01:33.790">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.200" end="01:38.020"><span begin="01:35.200" end="01:35.440">It's </span><span begin="01:35.440" end="01:35.770">not </span><span begin="01:35.770" end="01:36.070">the </span><span begin="01:36.070" end="01:36.550">way </span><span begin="01:36.550" end="01:36.730">I </span><span begin="01:36.730" end="01:37.600">planned </span><span begin="01:37.600" end="01:38.020">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.050" end="01:42.550"><span begin="01:38.050" end="01:38.830">Show </span><span begin="01:38.830" end="01:39.430">me </span><span begin="01:39.430" end="01:39.790">how </span><span begin="01:39.790" end="01:40.150">you </span><span begin="01:40.150" end="01:40.630">want </span><span begin="01:40.630" end="01:40.840">it </span><span begin="01:40.840" end="01:41.530">to </span><span begin="01:41.530" end="01:42.550">be</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.880" end="01:44.920"><span begin="01:42.880" end="01:43.270">Tell </span><span begin="01:43.270" end="01:43.570">me </span><span begin="01:43.570" end="01:44.920">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.950" end="01:47.560"><span begin="01:44.950" end="01:45.460">'Cause </span><span begin="01:45.460" end="01:45.670">I </span><span begin="01:45.670" end="01:46.030">need </span><span begin="01:46.030" end="01:46.240">to </span><span begin="01:46.240" end="01:46.990">know </span><span begin="01:46.990" end="01:47.560">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.590" end="01:49.240"><span begin="01:47.590" end="01:48.415">Oh </span><span begin="01:48.415" end="01:49.240"